+Releases are automatic: the release autopilot (`release-autopilot.yml`) opens `release/vX.Y.Z` → `main` once `develop` has been quiet for 2 hours (at most one version a day) and merges it with a merge commit when green. The version level comes from your PR title (`feat:` → minor, `fix:` → patch, `feat!:` or a `BREAKING CHANGE:` footer → major) and from your `changelog.d/` fragment; a `semver:major|minor|patch|none` label overrides it. Details: [`docs/RELEASE.md`](https://github.com/krovomi/WorkPilot-AI/blob/develop/docs/RELEASE.md).
